{"query":"What primary data source (e.g., CDC, state health departments, Johns Hopkins) supports a covid-19 death count exceeding 225,000 at the time of the statement?","results":[{"date":"Aug 7, 2026","position":1,"site_name":"www.cdc.gov","snippet":"This page provides an overview of COVID-19 data and trends over time. Other COVID-19 related data visualizations (previously on CDC’s COVID Data Tracker) are provided in the resources section at the bottom of this page.","title":"Surveillance and Data Analytics | Covid | CDC","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/covid/php/surveillance/index.html"},{"date":"Apr 21, 2026","position":2,"site_name":"www.cdc.gov","snippet":"Deaths Access provisional death counts based on information obtained from death certificates.","title":"COVID-19 Data from the National Center for Health Statistics","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/covid19/index.htm"},{"date":"Apr 10, 2023","position":3,"site_name":"archive.cdc.gov","snippet":"CDC receives line-level data primarily from state health departments. Information is de-identified and does not include names or home addresses. CDC makes line-level data available through patient-level data sets.","title":"FAQ: COVID-19 Data and Surveillance | CDC","url":"https://archive.cdc.gov/www_cdc_gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/covid-data/faq-surveillance.html"},{"date":"Oct 23, 2026","position":4,"site_name":"data.cdc.gov","snippet":"This dataset represents preliminary weekly estimates of cumulative U.S. COVID-19 burden, including illnesses, outpatient visits, hospitalizations and deaths, since the start of 2024 respiratory season.","title":"Preliminary U.S. COVID-19 Burden Estimates - Data.CDC.gov","url":"https://data.cdc.gov/Public-Health-Surveillance/Preliminary-2024-2025-U-S-COVID-19-Burden-Estimate/ahrf-yqdt"},{"date":"Jan 13, 2025","position":5,"site_name":"data.cdc.gov","snippet":"Data published by CDC public health programs to help save lives and protect people from health, safety, and security threats.","title":"Data | Centers for Disease Control and Prevention","url":"https://data.cdc.gov/"},{"date":"Jun 20, 2026","position":6,"site_name":"healthdata.gov","snippet":"Here you will find health and human services data, tools, and resources to conduct research, develop web and mobile applications, design data visualizations, and more.","title":"HealthData.gov","url":"https://healthdata.gov/"},{"position":7,"site_name":"stacks.cdc.gov","snippet":"CDC COVID Data Tracker is CDC’s home for COVID-19 data. It provides surveillance data from across the response, including hospitalizations, vaccinations, demographic information, and daily and cumulative case and death counts reported to CDC since January 21, 2020.","title":"FAQ: COVID-19 Data and Surveillance - CDC Stacks","url":"https://stacks.cdc.gov/view/cdc/134079/cdc_134079_DS1.pdf"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}